      "level": "info",
      "msg": "commands are imported in Cobra's alphabetical order; rotini lists them in the order the spec declares them"
    },
    {
      "path": "acmecli",
      "level": "info",
      "msg": "flags and commands added inside a hook (PersistentPreRun, PreRun, Run), an OnInitialize function or a plugin loader are not in the walked tree and were not imported"
